(10000,1000,1,NULL,4,'Works as advertised. Comfortable to use for long sessions and the battery life is decent.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1705608507)),
(10001,1001,1,NULL,5,'Plug-and-play simple and the build quality is solid. Performance is exactly what I needed for the price.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1700937563)),
(10002,1002,1,NULL,5,'Reliable and well designed. Has been working flawlessly for months. Would buy again without hesitation.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1703454781)),
(10003,1003,1,NULL,5,'Reliable and well designed. Has been working flawlessly for months. Would buy again without hesitation.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1709575426)),
(10004,1004,1,NULL,5,'Great little device. Does exactly what it says on the tin and feels premium in the hand.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1707027293)),
(10005,1005,1,NULL,5,'Great little device. Does exactly what it says on the tin and feels premium in the hand.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1708026036)),
(10006,1000,2,NULL,5,'Handles video editing and large spreadsheets without breaking a sweat. The fanless design means it runs silently under normal use. Build quality is rock solid.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1703933082)),
(10007,1001,2,NULL,5,'Lightweight, fast, and the battery life is phenomenal — I get through a full day of meetings without plugging in. Highly recommend.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1707292271)),
(10008,1002,2,NULL,4,'Excellent display and the keyboard is a joy to type on. Performance is great for coding and office work. Could use a couple more ports but a hub solves that.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1710114495)),
(10009,1003,2,NULL,5,'Incredible performance for the size and weight. The keyboard is comfortable for long typing sessions and the screen is sharp and colour accurate. Battery easily covers a full workday.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1709909817)),
(10010,1004,2,NULL,4,'Great laptop for everyday productivity. Performance is snappy and the trackpad is the best I have used. The base RAM can feel limiting if you keep many tabs open.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1708310761)),
(10011,1005,2,NULL,5,'Handles video editing and large spreadsheets without breaking a sweat. The fanless design means it runs silently under normal use. Build quality is rock solid.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1713268815)),
(10012,1000,3,NULL,4,'Sound is excellent and the ANC works very well on buses and trains. Slightly expensive but the quality justifies it.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1708505130)),
(10013,1001,3,NULL,5,'Best purchase I have made this year. Multipoint pairing works seamlessly between my laptop and phone. Mic quality on calls is clear.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1701499312)),
(10014,1002,3,NULL,4,'Great headphones with excellent sound and build. The app EQ is useful. They do get a little warm after extended wear but it is not a dealbreaker.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1710726838)),
(10015,1003,3,NULL,5,'Sound quality is rich and balanced with deep but controlled bass. Comfortable for hours of listening thanks to the soft ear cushions.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1705998034)),
(10016,1004,3,NULL,5,'Noise cancelling is genuinely industry-leading. I use them on flights and the engine drone disappears completely. Battery life matches the advertised 30 hours.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1707513720)),
(10017,1005,3,NULL,2,'The headband clamp is too tight for my head — I get ear fatigue after about an hour. Returning.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1712230219)),
(10018,1000,4,NULL,5,'Upgraded from my old phone and the difference is night and day. The display is bright and crisp, the camera takes sharp photos even in low light, and the battery comfortably lasts a full day of heavy use.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1710279086)),
(10019,1001,4,NULL,4,'Great phone overall — performance is snappy and the screen is gorgeous. Only minor complaint is that it gets a bit warm during long gaming sessions, but nothing concerning.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1708281000)),
(10020,1002,4,NULL,5,'Best phone I have owned. The display refresh rate makes everything silky smooth and the speakers are louder than I expected. Worth every penny.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1703671304)),
(10021,1003,4,NULL,5,'Best phone I have owned. The display refresh rate makes everything silky smooth and the speakers are louder than I expected. Worth every penny.',FROM_UNIXTIME(1711066531)),
