-- Update descriptions with richer, category-aware content
UPDATE product SET description = 'iPhone 15 Pro combines reliable performance with thoughtful design. Plug-and-play simple to set up, it delivers the features described and is built with quality components for long service life. Backed by manufacturer warranty and VeriCart AI authentication, so you can shop with complete confidence.' WHERE id = 1;
UPDATE product SET description = 'MacBook Air M3 is built for productivity and creativity on the go. The latest-generation processor and fast SSD deliver instant boot times and smooth performance for office work, programming, photo/video editing, and casual gaming. The high-resolution display is colour-calibrated out of the box, and the backlit keyboard is comfortable for long typing sessions. All-day battery life, a lightweight aluminium chassis, and a full set of ports (USB-C, USB-A, HDMI, headphone jack) make it ideal for both desk and travel use. VeriCart authentication guarantees a brand-new, factory-sealed unit with full manufacturer warranty.' WHERE id = 2;
UPDATE product SET description = 'Sony WH-1000XM5 delivers studio-quality sound with deep, controlled bass, clear mids, and detailed highs. Industry-leading active noise cancellation adapts to your environment, while transparency mode lets in natural sound when you need to stay aware. Multipoint Bluetooth lets you stay connected to two devices at once, and the battery delivers up to 30 hours of playback per charge. Plush memory-foam ear cushions and an adjustable headband keep them comfortable for hours. Every pair sold on VeriCart is verified authentic and ships in factory-sealed packaging with full manufacturer warranty.' WHERE id = 3;
UPDATE product SET description = 'Samsung Galaxy S24 combines premium build quality with flagship performance. Powered by a top-tier mobile chipset, it delivers smooth multitasking, console-quality gaming, and efficient battery use. The high-refresh display produces vibrant, accurate colours and remains readable even in direct sunlight. The multi-lens camera system captures sharp detail in daylight and clean, low-noise shots at night, with AI scene optimisation and 4K video recording. Fast wired and wireless charging, IP-rated water resistance, and the latest connectivity standards (5G, Wi-Fi 6/6E, Bluetooth 5+) round out a complete package. Every unit sold on VeriCart is verified authentic and ships with full warranty and a tamper-evident seal.' WHERE id = 4;
UPDATE product SET description = 'Nike Air Max 270 is crafted from premium-quality fabric with a tailored fit and clean finish. Reinforced stitching at stress points and pre-shrunk material ensure the piece holds its shape wash after wash. Breathable and comfortable for all-day wear, it transitions easily from casual to smart-casual settings. Each item is inspected and shipped in protective packaging by VeriCart AI, guaranteed authentic with a 30-day fit and quality guarantee.' WHERE id = 5;
UPDATE product SET description = 'Dyson V15 Detect brings professional-grade cleaning (or cooking) performance into the home. Powerful suction (or even heat distribution), intuitive controls, and a versatile set of attachments make quick work of everyday tasks. Lightweight, well balanced, and easy to store. VeriCart AI authenticates every unit and ships in tamper-evident packaging with full manufacturer warranty.' WHERE id = 6;
UPDATE product SET description = 'Kindle Paperwhite makes reading and note-taking a pleasure. The high-resolution, anti-glare display is easy on the eyes even in direct sunlight, and adjustable warm light helps you read comfortably at night. Waterproofing (where applicable), weeks-long battery life, and seamless library syncing across devices make it the perfect everyday companion. VeriCart AI authenticates every unit and ships with full manufacturer warranty.' WHERE id = 7;
UPDATE product SET description = 'Logitech MX Master 3S combines reliable performance with thoughtful design. Plug-and-play simple to set up, it delivers the features described and is built with quality components for long service life. Backed by manufacturer warranty and VeriCart AI authentication, so you can shop with complete confidence.' WHERE id = 8;
UPDATE product SET description = 'iPad Air M2 strikes the ideal balance between portability and capability. The vibrant display is perfect for reading, streaming, sketching, and note-taking, with stylus support and low-latency input for creative workflows. The chipset handles multitasking, light editing, and modern games without breaking a sweat, while the battery delivers all-day endurance. Lightweight and thin, it slips easily into a bag and pairs seamlessly with wireless keyboards and styluses for laptop-style productivity. VeriCart AI verifies authenticity and ships every unit with tamper-evident packaging and full warranty.' WHERE id = 9;
UPDATE product SET description = 'Canon EOS R6 Mark II is a professional-grade imaging tool for stills and video. The high-resolution back-illuminated sensor captures excellent detail with wide dynamic range, while AI-assisted autofocus locks on quickly and tracks subjects reliably for sports, wildlife, and events. In-body stabilisation keeps handheld shots sharp and video footage smooth. 4K (and in some models 6K/8K) video, 10-bit colour, and dual card slots make it ready for serious production work. VeriCart AI authenticates every unit and ships with full manufacturer warranty, ensuring you receive a brand-new, factory-sealed body.' WHERE id = 10;
UPDATE product SET description = 'Apple Watch Series 9 combines premium materials with comprehensive health and fitness tracking. Continuous heart-rate and SpO2 monitoring, advanced sleep analysis, ECG, and stress tracking give you a clear picture of your wellbeing. Built-in GPS accurately tracks runs, rides, and swims without your phone, while the always-on AMOLED display is bright outdoors and easy to read at a glance. Notifications, music control, contactless payments, and a robust app ecosystem keep you connected on the go. VeriCart AI authenticates every unit and ships with full manufacturer warranty.' WHERE id = 11;
